  "meta": { "confirm": "dualshock.cross", "cancel": "dualshock.circle", "primary": "dualshock.cross", "secondary": "dualshock.square" },
  "_notes": "PlayStation layouts are already positional (cross=south, circle=east, square=west, triangle=north), so no label_positions. The 'analog' (mode) button is unbound: DuckStation/Beetle can force analog mode or toggle it with a hotkey, and guide belongs to Steam. Western convention: cross confirms, circle cancels. Japanese releases swap these; that is a per-game rule. digital is the original pad (SCPH-1080). Analog-stick-only controllers (Dual Analog, NeGcon, GunCon) are not modelled."
}
